text = "Slopes: pick Ground, then the slope tool next to the fill tool, and drag the ground's surface.
Diagonal drags draw steep or gentle slopes; start under a ceiling for a ceiling slope; Shift for a thin one.
The pieces are set up in Options > Slopes. The tileset also uses must-not rules."
